# Server + online identity / progress / leaderboard

## Server (`server/`)

| Path | Role |
|------|------|
| `docker-compose.yml` | Postgres + Nakama (`name: goofyballs`) |
| `.env` | Secrets (gitignored) |
| `nakama/local.yml` | Config + `runtime.env` |
| `nakama/modules/identity.lua` | Auth RPCs + Yandex custom hooks |
| `nakama/modules/progress.lua` | `progress_pull` / `push` / `merge` + Storage |
| `nakama/modules/leaderboard.lua` | `submit_match_result` / `leaderboard_top` + `global_wins` |
| `scripts/smoke.ps1` | Stack health |
| `scripts/smoke_identity.ps1` | Device auth + identity RPCs |
| `scripts/smoke_progress.ps1` | Device auth + progress merge/pull |
| `scripts/smoke_leaderboard.ps1` | Ranked submit + top list |

### Storage contract

- collection `player`, key `progress`
- value: PData fields + `schema_version` + `updated_at` (+ `wins_ranked`)
- writes only via RPC (`permission_write = 0` on object)
- merge policy: `max()` on additive counters

### Leaderboard

- id `global_wins` — authoritative, desc, operator `set`, ranks on
- Only `mode: "ranked"` + local win updates the board
- `vs_ai` / `local_2p` → RPC ok, no board write (casual progress via `progress_merge`)
- Light rate limit: 2s between submits / user

### Must

- Pin image tags; secrets in `.env`; mount `./nakama` → `/nakama/data`
- YAML under `server/` — **spaces only** (tabs break parsers)
- Key all player data by Nakama `user_id`
- After changing modules: `docker compose restart nakama`

### Ports

`5432` Postgres · `7349` gRPC · `7350` HTTP/WS · `7351` Console

## Client (`src/features/online/`)

- `PlatformAuth` + `OnlineService` (optional auto-login)
- `OnlineProgress` wrap/merge helpers
- `SaveManager._online_service` optional — disk first, cloud best-effort
- AppRoot after match: local PData + best-effort `submit_match_result`
- Must not block offline AI / local 2P; `core/` must not import Nakama

Plan: `.cursor/plans/online-server-backend.plan.md`
